  "research_notes": "Iteration 15 appraise update. All due new discovery results assessed. No validation request because voluntary validation budget is exhausted. Accepted core dataset-specific associations remain: feature_037=1, feature_027=1, and feature_063=1 are associated with stronger composite dependency, while feature_002=1 and feature_010=1 are associated with weaker dependency. New feature_063 context localization: feature_063 stronger dependency is strong in feature_018<=0 (H180) and especially feature_038>=0/feature_018<=0 (H181). Within feature_018<=0, feature_063 association is more negative in feature_038>=0 than in its complement (H183). Core-zero splits show feature_063 effect strong in core-zero feature_018<=0 (H184) and weak/below-threshold in core-zero feature_018>=0 average (H185 rejected for meaningfulness), but feature_063 remains meaningful in core-zero feature_038>=0/feature_018>=0 (H187). Direct core-zero feature_038>=0 effect is strong (H173), while core-zero feature_038<=0 is null (H176). Feature_038 modification persists in core-zero feature_018<=0 (H188) and feature_018>=0 (H189), stronger in feature_018<=0. Core-zero feature_018 attenuation interaction is accepted but magnitude uncertain (H190 active). H164 broad feature_038>=0/feature_018>=0 remains unresolved and closed for further follow-up. Remaining useful active checks are stricter feature_038>=1 (H175), stricter feature_018>=1 attenuation (H182, H191), and other localized feature_040/feature_046 checks. All conclusions remain observational, label-opaque, non-causal, non-generalizable, and multiplicity-limited."
